Its DiskUsage read_bytes/written_bytes and NetworkData received/transmitted
already measure bytes since the last refresh. Do not subtract them again.

This fixture supports exact transforms/refusals/real Git application. It does
not establish whole-app compilation, cancellation of nvidia-smi/flatpak-spawn,
physical sampling precision, device/reset/error coverage or desktop behavior.
Default decimal MB/s labels clarify units; existing user configuration and schema
remain untouched. Original GPU subprocess/provider behavior remains unbounded.
